1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Saidha: "Dheweke Allah, sing Maha Asih.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Allah yaiku Gusti sing dijagani kabeh perkara.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Dheweke ora nglairake lan ora dipun lairake.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Lan ora ana sing padha karo dheweke."
